==Battleground==
*1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 103.33 seconds<sup>3,100f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This level is basically a much more extreme version of [[Littering Coast]]. The main threat here are the Assassin Bears, and not Dober P.D. It is recommended to bring either Defense Up or [[Cat Cannon]] Recharge Up [[Cat Combo]]s, as you don't really need that many slots here. Remember to have a full Cat Cannon ready for the Assassin Bear that comes out on base hit, otherwise you will most likely die.

Your goal is to defeat Dober P.D. as quickly as possible. The best way to do this is with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] who, when protected by Wave Shields like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] (if owned), can tear through Dober's HP in seconds. It's recommended to use him in tandem with a few [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attacking Cats]] like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] to snipe the Assassin Bears. Otherwise, [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]], or [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] (in 4-crown) makes quick work of them.

==='''Recommended ubers'''===
*[[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]]: Can deal extremely high DPS to Dober when backed up by Wave Shields, making the battle quicker

